{"4288030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stuck in a Well with a Frog", "steam_appid": 4288030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/949b000fa61244925a9fcd721c5bbce1.webp?t=1781536882\" width=512 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a first-person absurd comedy game where your only way up depends on the frog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/01ff4f8c11447271506b2db842978a58.poster.avif?t=1781536882\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/01ff4f8c11447271506b2db842978a58.webm?t=1781536882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/01ff4f8c11447271506b2db842978a58.mp4?t=1781536882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trapped at the bottom of a deep well. There’s no inventory, no upgrades, and no clear plan. <br>Instead, you dig through dirt with your bare hands, face absurd challenges and feed items to a frog - hoping it digests something useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it helps.<br> Sometimes it doesn’t.<br> Sometimes it makes things worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30% - Digging through dirt</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10% - Feeding items to the frog to receive something useful </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10% - Building ladders</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20% - Dealing with absurd meme challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50% - Recognizing the references</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/6a1a6077cfd78921c0a61708794fdafb.poster.avif?t=1781536882\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/6a1a6077cfd78921c0a61708794fdafb.webm?t=1781536882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/6a1a6077cfd78921c0a61708794fdafb.mp4?t=1781536882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Main gameplay isn't about the frog.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>But the frog isn't optional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/65c58c746d71368ee9f8e841795134d1.avif?t=1781536882\" width=512 height=115 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/949b000fa61244925a9fcd721c5bbce1.webp?t=1781536882\" width=512 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a first-person absurd comedy game where your only way up depends on the frog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/01ff4f8c11447271506b2db842978a58.poster.avif?t=1781536882\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/01ff4f8c11447271506b2db842978a58.webm?t=1781536882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/01ff4f8c11447271506b2db842978a58.mp4?t=1781536882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trapped at the bottom of a deep well. There’s no inventory, no upgrades, and no clear plan. <br>Instead, you dig through dirt with your bare hands, face absurd challenges and feed items to a frog - hoping it digests something useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it helps.<br> Sometimes it doesn’t.<br> Sometimes it makes things worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30% - Digging through dirt</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10% - Feeding items to the frog to receive something useful </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10% - Building ladders</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20% - Dealing with absurd meme challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50% - Recognizing the references</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/6a1a6077cfd78921c0a61708794fdafb.poster.avif?t=1781536882\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/6a1a6077cfd78921c0a61708794fdafb.webm?t=1781536882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288030/extras/6a1a6077cfd78921c0a61708794fdafb.mp4?t=1781536882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s